Package: icetools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Managing Initial Conditions for Quantitative Trade Models
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Julian Hinz
Maintainer: Julian Hinz <mail@julianhinz.com>
Description: A package to create, read, validate, and manage .ice files used for initial conditions in quantitative trade models. Includes metadata handling and table validation.
